# Blocks of six code lines or more that stand in more than one place
# (tests/structural/block.rs, the ruling of 2026-11-24: duplication is a
# defect, and a part does one job and nothing else). One group per run,
# however long the run: a group that is another group sliding is not
# counted. A copy made raises the count and a copy removed lowers it: both
# fail the run, so this file says what is left to do.
